Did you give the robot you just trained the new box?

Did you vacuum up the 1000 and the first number from his thought bubble?

Did you give the box to the robot to test things?

Did you flip the 2 over and put the robot and box on the back?

Did you flip the number back over and set it down to watch it work?

Well, I'd drop the seconds timer in the first hole of the box.  
I'd vacuum up the first number and the 1000 from the robot's thought bubble.
Then I'd give the box to the robot.  Once I see it's working fine
I'd flip the 2 over by pressing 'f' and put
the robot on the back.  Then I'd give the robot the box and pick up
the number and flip it back over. 


